language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Mario starts at his house and ends at Luigi's house, visiting a set of houses on one circuit that closes from Luigi's house back to Mario's house. Choose the route that collects the most gold without using more fuel than the limit.
given nHouses : int(1..)
given marioHouse, luigiHouse : int(0..)
given fuelLimit : int(0..)
$ goldInHouse[i] is the gold in house i (houses are numbered from 0 in the data, so house h is model index h+1)
given goldInHouse : matrix indexed by [int(1..nHouses)] of int(0..)
$ arc_fuel[i,j] is the fuel used to travel from house i to house j
given arc_fuel : matrix indexed by [int(1..nHouses), int(1..nHouses)] of int(0..)
$ s[i] is the house succeeding house i on the route, s[i] = i-1 when house i is not on the route
find s : matrix indexed by [int(1..nHouses)] of int(0..nHouses-1)
$ ord[i] is the position of house i on the route, counted from Mario's house as 0
find ord : matrix indexed by [int(1..nHouses)] of int(0..nHouses)
find total_gold : int(0..sum(goldInHouse))

maximising total_gold
such that
$ the successors form a permutation, so every house has one predecessor on the route
allDiff(s),
$ the total gold is the gold of the houses on the route
total_gold = (sum i : int(1..nHouses) . toInt(s[i] != i-1) * goldInHouse[i]),
$ the total fuel of the arcs travelled on the route, including the arc from Luigi's house back to Mario's house, is within the fuel limit
(sum i : int(1..nHouses) . toInt(s[i] != i-1) * arc_fuel[i, s[i]+1]) <= fuelLimit,
$ Mario's house is on the route, and the route leaves it
s[marioHouse+1] != marioHouse,
$ the route ends at Luigi's house, whose successor is Mario's house
s[luigiHouse+1] = marioHouse,
$ Mario's house is the first position of the route
ord[marioHouse+1] = 0,
$ each house on the route is one position after its predecessor, so the route is a single circuit from Mario's house and no separate loop of houses is formed
forAll i : int(1..nHouses) . ((s[i] != i-1) /\ (i != luigiHouse+1)) -> (ord[s[i]+1] = ord[i] + 1),
$ houses not on the route have position 0
forAll i : int(1..nHouses) . (s[i] = i-1) -> (ord[i] = 0)
